      "content": "Answer the following question with a single MySQL SQL query against the current database. Explore the semantic network and verify with mysql_query as needed. The SELECT list must contain exactly the columns the question asks for, in the asked order. When the final SQL is verified, call the submit_SQL tool with it.\n\nThe following hints are provided to help you write the SQL:\n\n## Gold Tables\n- FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY\n- FCLT_ORGANIZATION\n- SPACE_UNIT\n- MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY\n\n## Column Mapping\n- department name: MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY.DLC_NAME\n- organization key: FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n- Provost Area: MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_2_NAME\n- number of organizations: FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n- minimum department hierarchy level 3 codes: MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_3_CODE\n- maximum department hierarchy level 3 codes: MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_3_CODE\n- organization name: FCLT_ORGANIZATION.ORGANIZATION_NAME\n- number of associated space units: SPACE_UNIT.SPACE_UNIT_KEY\n- average number of space units: SPACE_UNIT.SPACE_UNIT_KEY\n- holder category: SPACE_UNIT.SPACE_UNIT_KEY\n\n## Join Keys\n- FCLT_ORGANIZATION.DLC_KEY <-> FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY.DLC_KEY\n- FCLT_ORGANIZATION.DLC_KEY <-> SPACE_UNIT.DLC_KEY\n- FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY.DLC_KEY <-> MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY.DLC_KEY\n\n## Subquery Decomposition\n1. List the top 10 organizations by the number of associated space units, showing the organization name and the count of space units for each.\n```sql\nSELECT fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME, COUNT(su.SPACE_UNIT_KEY) AS space_unit_count FROM FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY fok JOIN FCLT_ORGANIZATION fo ON fok.DLC_KEY = fo.DLC_KEY JOIN SPACE_UNIT su ON fo.DLC_KEY = su.DLC_KEY GROUP BY fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME ORDER BY space_unit_count DESC LIMIT 10;\n```\n2. For each department name and its corresponding organization key where the department is in the Provost Area, provide the number of organizations and the minimum department hierarchy level 3 code.\n```sql\nSELECT m.DLC_NAME, f.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY, COUNT(f.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY) AS org_count, MIN(m.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_3_CODE) AS min_level3_code FROM MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY m JOIN FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY f ON m.DLC_KEY = f.DLC_KEY WHERE m.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_2_NAME = 'Provost Area' GROUP BY m.DLC_NAME, f.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY;\n```\n3. For each organization, show the organization name, the number of associated space units, and whether the organization is a 'LARGE_HOLDER' (at least 20% more space units than the average), 'SMALL_HOLDER' (at least 20% fewer space units than the average), or 'AVERAGE_HOLDER' otherwise.\n```sql\nWITH inner_cte AS ( SELECT fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME, COUNT(su.SPACE_UNIT_KEY) AS space_unit_count FROM FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY fok JOIN FCLT_ORGANIZATION fo ON fok.DLC_KEY = fo.DLC_KEY JOIN SPACE_UNIT su ON fo.DLC_KEY = su.DLC_KEY GROUP BY fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME ) SELECT ic.ORGANIZATION_NAME, ic.space_unit_count, avg_stats.avg_space_units, CASE WHEN ic.space_unit_count > avg_stats.avg_space_units * 1.2 THEN 'LARGE_HOLDER' WHEN ic.space_unit_count < avg_stats.avg_space_units * 0.8 THEN 'SMALL_HOLDER' ELSE 'AVERAGE_HOLDER' END AS holder_category FROM inner_cte ic CROSS JOIN ( SELECT AVG(space_unit_count) AS avg_space_units FROM inner_cte ) avg_stats;\n```\n4. For each department name and its corresponding organization key where the department is in the Provost Area, provide the number of organizations, the minimum department hierarchy level 3 code, and the maximum department hierarchy level 3 code.\n```sql\nWITH inner_cte AS ( SELECT m.DLC_NAME, f.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY, COUNT(f.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY) AS org_count, MIN(m.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_3_CODE) AS min_level3_code FROM MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY m JOIN FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY f ON m.DLC_KEY = f.DLC_KEY WHERE m.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_2_NAME = 'Provost Area' GROUP BY m.DLC_NAME, f.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY ) SELECT i.DLC_NAME, i.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY, i.org_count, i.min_level3_code, MAX(m.MASTER_DEPT_HIER_LEVEL_3_CODE) AS max_level3_code FROM inner_cte i JOIN MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY m ON i.DLC_NAME = m.DLC_NAME GROUP BY i.DLC_NAME, i.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY, i.org_count, i.min_level3_code;\n```\n\n## Question\nFor each department name and its corresponding organization key in the Provost Area, show the number of organizations, the minimum and maximum department hierarchy level 3 codes, the organization name, the number of associated space units, the average number of space units, and whether the organization is a 'LARGE_HOLDER', 'SMALL_HOLDER', or 'AVERAGE_HOLDER' based on space unit count. List the results ordered by department name and organization name. Do not return any rounded answers."
